  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "In art class, we sit around a large table. There is paint, a brush, and paper in front of me. I use a crayon to draw a yellow flower. My friend draws a colorful garden beside my picture. Then I cut a round shape out of paper. I also make a square piece for a little house. We use glue to put our work on a big sheet. Our teacher helps us find a place on the wall. We stand back and smile at our work together.",
    "textZh": "美術課上，我們圍著一張大桌子坐。我面前有顏料、筆刷和紙。我用蠟筆畫一朵黃色的花。朋友在我的圖旁畫了一個色彩繽紛的花園。接著我從紙上剪出一個圓形。我也做一片正方形紙，拿來做小房子。我們用膠水把作品貼在一大張紙上。老師幫我們在牆上找個位置。我們一起退後站著，對自己的作品微笑。",
